\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). Becoming a family man or king in the material world is not harmful if one accepts everything for K\'e5\'f1\'eba's service. That necessitates clear intelligence. M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 philosophers say, }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahma satya\'e0 jagan mithy\'e4:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  this material world is false, and only the Absolute Truth is real. However, an intelligent devotee in the line of Lord Brahm\'e4 and the great sage N\'e4rada
\emdash or, in other words, in the Brahma-samprad\'e4ya\emdash does not consider this world false. That which is created by the Supreme Personality of Godhead cannot be false, but using it for enjoyment is. Everything is meant to be enjoyed by the Su
preme Personality of Godhead, as confirmed in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 5.29}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhokt\'e4ra\'e0 yaj\'efa-tapas
