\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  of his past life, it is one's birth that determines his social status. Others say, however, that one's birth according to the }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  of his past life is not the essential consideration, since one can change his }{
