 has the symptoms of a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  he should be designated as a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Similarly, if a }{
