 according to the Vedic instructions, our lives will be successful. Unless human society is thus divided and arranged, it cannot be perfect. As stated in the }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vi\'f1\'ebu Pur\'e4\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{
