u, is worshiped by the proper execution of prescribed duties in the system of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 var\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e4\'e7rama.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 There is no other way to satisfy the Supreme Personality of Godhead. One must be situated in the institution of the four }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 var\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e4\'e7ramas.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 " All of human society is meant to worship Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. At the present moment, however, human society does not know that this is the ultimate goal or perfection of life. Therefore i}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4003086 
nstead of worshiping Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4003086 p}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
eople have been educated to worship matter. According to the direction of modern society, men think they can advance in civilization by manipulating matter to build skyscrapers, big roads, automobiles a
nd so on. Such a civilization must certainly be called materialistic because its people do not know the goal of life. The goal of life is to reach Vi\'f1\'ebu, but instead of reaching Vi\'f1\'eb
u, people are bewildered by the external manifestation of the material energy. Therefore progress in material advancement is blind, and the leaders of such material advancement are also blind. They are leading their followers in the wrong way.
