\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karm\'e9s,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  who act for themselves, are bound by the reactions of their work. A liberated person, th
erefore, does not think about whatever he has ignorantly done in the past; instead, he acts in such a way that he will not produce another body by fruitive activities. As clearly mentioned in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4:
