\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 parampar\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  system. As described in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 4.2}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 eva\'e0 parampar\'e4 pr\'e4ptam:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  o
ne has to receive the instructions of the Supreme Lord through the disciplic chain of spiritual masters. A devotee of the Lord always considers himself a servant of the servant of the servant of the Lord.
