\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 Lord Brahm\'e4
 was then worshiped by Manu, who respectfully satisfied him as well as he could. Priyavrata and N\'e4rada also looked upon Brahm\'e4 with no tinges of resentment. Having engaged Priyavrata in accepting his father's request, Lord Brahm\'e4
 returned to his abode, Satyaloka, which is indescribable by the endeavor of mundane mind or words.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319\charrsid2844196 PURPORT}{\insrsid11612319 
