\'f1i-vara}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash of the great sage N\'e4rada; }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 anumatena}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash by the permission; }{
\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 \'e4tma-jam}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash his son; }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 akhila}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash of the entire universe; }{
