{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (Bg. 6.47)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid399220  Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Priyavrata,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  therefore, was a liberated person and was among the highest of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
