}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 v\'e4sudeva\'f9 sarvam iti.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  The lotus feet of V\'e4sudeva are everything. Lord V\'e4
sudeva is the reservoir of all living entities. When this cosmic manifestation is dissolved, all living entities enter the supreme body of the Lord, Garbhodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu, who merges within the body of Mah\'e4-Vi\'f1\'ebu. Both of these }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 vi\'f1\'ebu-tattvas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  are }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 v\'e4sudeva-tattvas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and therefore the great sages Kavi, Mah\'e4v\'e9
ra and Savana concentrated always upon the lotus feet of Lord V\'e4sudeva, K\'e5\'f1\'eba. In this way they could understand that the 
Supersoul within the heart is the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and they could recognize their identity with Him. The complete description of this realization is that simply by discharging the unalloyed form of devotional service, one can realize his se
lf completely. The }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 parama-bhakti-yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 mentioned in this verse means that a living entity, by dint of unalloyed devotional service, has no other interest than the service of the Lord, as described in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 v\'e4sudeva\'f9 sarvam iti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). By }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 parama-bhakti-yoga,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 by elevating oneself to the highest platform of loving service, one can automatically be relieved from the bodily concept of life and see the Supreme Personality of Godhead face to face. As confirmed in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Brahma-sa\'e0
hit\'e4:
