While enjoying his material opulences with full strength and influence, Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Priyavrata once began to consider that although he had fully surrendered to the great saint N\'e4rada and was actually on the path of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, he had somehow become again entangled in material activities. Thus his mind now became restless, and he began to speak in a spirit of renunciation.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
