ed to renounce material attachment. M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 philosophers, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 try to give up this material world simply by saying, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahma satya\'e0 jagan mithy\'e4:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  "This world is false. There is no use of it. Let us take to Brahman." Such theoretical knowledge wi
