\'e4t\'e4la. A devotee, however, knows that they are all material, and consequently he is not at all interested in them. As stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
