\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  who practice controlling the venomous senses. As recommended in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  should practice }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 samprek\'f1ya n\'e4sik\'e4gram,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  keeping their eyes half-open. If
 the eyes are closed completely, there will be a tendency to sleep. So-called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  sometimes practice a fashionable form of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{
