 That is, "Upon gaining this, one thinks that there is no greater gain." When one realizes God and sees the Lord face to face, one certainly thinks that he has gained the best of all things. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Raso 'py asya para\'e0 d\'e5
