\'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu would not have said, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mama janmani janmani.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 It doesn't matter to a devotee whether or not he takes birth life after life, as long as he remains a devotee. Actually eternal liberty means returning home, back to Godhead. A devotee is never concerned about anything material. Although N\'e4bhi Mah\'e4
r\'e4ja wanted a son like Vi\'f1\'ebu, wanting a son like God is also a form of sense gratification. A pure devotee wants only to engage in the Lord's loving service.
