\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  A devotee does not at all desire anything for sense gratification. Devotion is therefore explained as devoid of material desires (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 any\'e4bhil\'e4
