\'c5\'f1abhadeva is an incarnation of the Supreme Lord, and therefore He was the original Bhagav\'e4n. Consequently He is described herein as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoge\'e7vara,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 which indicates that He has the most powerful spiritual potency. He is not dependent on King Indra for water. He can supply water Himself, and He did so in this case. In }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 it is stated: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'ef\'e4d bhavati parjanya\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Due to the performance of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'efa,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 clouds of water are manifest in the sky. Clouds and rainfall are under the management of Indra, the heavenly King, but when Indra is neglectful, the Supreme Lord Himself, who is also known as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'efa}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  or }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'efa-pati,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  takes the task upon Himself. Consequently there was sufficient rainfall in the place named Ajan\'e4bha. When }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
yaj\'efa-pati}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  wants to, He can do anything without the help of any subordinate. Therefore the Supreme Lord is known as almighty. In the present age of Kali there will eventually be a great scarcity of water (}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 an\'e4v\'e5\'f1\'f6i}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), for the general populace, due to ignorance and the scarcity of yaj\'efic ingredients, will neglect to perform }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'efas.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  therefore advises: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'efai\'f9 sa\'eck\'e9rtana-pr\'e4yai\'f9 yajanti hi sumedhasa\'f9.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  After all, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yaj\'efa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is meant to satisfy the Supreme Personality }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11299322 of Godhead. In this age of Kali,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 there is great scarcity and ignorance; nonetheless, everyone can perform }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sa\'eck\'e9rtana-yaj\'efa.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Every family in every society can conduct }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sa\'eck\'e9
rtana-yaj\'efa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  at least every evening. In this way there will be no disturbance or scarcity of rain. It is essential for the people in this age to perform the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sa\'eck\'e9rtana-yaj\'efa}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  in order to be materially happy and to advance spiritually.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.4.4
