\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  engaged as priests in the sacrificial ceremony were not ordinary }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'ebas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  They were so powerful that they could
 bring forth the Supreme Personality of Godhead by their prayers. Thus Mah\'e4r\'e4ja N\'e4bhi was able to see the Lord face to face. Unless one is a Vai\'f1\'eb
ava, he cannot call forth the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The Lord does not accept an invitation unless one is a Vai\'f1\'ebava. Therefore it is said in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Padma Pur\'e4\'eba:
\par }\pard\plain \s427\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 \'f1a\'f6-karma-nipu\'ebo vipro\line mantra-tantra-vi\'e7\'e4rada\'f9\line avai
\'f1\'ebavo gurur na sy\'e4d\line vai\'f1\'ebava\'f9 \'e7va-paco guru\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "A scholarly }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  expert in all subjects of Vedic knowledge is unfit to become a spiritual master without being a Vai\'f1\'ebava, but a person born in a family of a lower caste can become a spiritual master if he is a Vai\'f1\'ebava." These }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  were certainly very expert in chanting the Vedic }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mantras.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 They were competent in the performance of the Vedic rituals, and over and above this they were Vai\'f1\'ebavas. Therefore by their spiritual powers they could call on the Supreme Personality of Godhead and enable their disciple, Mah\'e4r\'e4ja N\'e4
bhi, to see the Lord face to face. \'c7r\'e9la Vi\'e7van\'e4tha Cakravart\'e9 \'d6h\'e4kura comments that the word }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ojas\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  means "by dint of devotional service."
