\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is meant for imperfect, conditioned souls. It trains them to become spiritually advanced in order to return home, back to Godh
ead. A civilization that does not know the highest aim of life is no better than an animal society. As stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 na te vidu\'f9
 sv\'e4rtha-gati\'e0 hi vi\'f1\'ebum.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  A human society is meant for elevation to spiritual knowledge so that all of the people can be freed from the clutches of birth, death, old age and disease. The }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  enables human society to become perfectly fit for getting out of the clutches of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 m\'e4y\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 and by following the regulative principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  one can become successful. In this regard, see }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (3.21-24)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 .
