\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 
When the living entity is covered by the mode of ignorance, he does not understand the individual living being and the supreme living being, and his mind is subjugated to fruitive activity. Therefore, until one has love for Lord V\'e4
sudeva, who is none other than Myself, he is certainly not delivered from having to accept a material body again and again.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
When the mind is polluted by fruitive activity, the living entity wants to be elevated from one material positi
on to another. Generally everyone is involved in working hard day and night to improve his economic condition. Even when one understands the Vedic rituals, he becomes interested in promotion to heavenly planets, not knowing that one's real interest lies i
n returning home, back to Godhead. By acting on the platform of fruitive activity, one wanders throughout the universe in different species and forms. Unless he comes in contact with a devotee of the Lord, a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 guru,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  he does not become attached to the service of Lord V\'e4sudeva. Knowledge of V\'e4sudeva requires many births to understand. As confirmed in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{
\cf1\insrsid11612319 7.19}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ): }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 v\'e4sudeva\'f9 sarvam iti sa mah\'e4tm\'e4 sudurlabha\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  After struggling for existence for many births}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid13253520 ,
}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  one may take shelter at the lotus feet of V\'e4sudeva, K\'e5\'f1\'eba. When this happens}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid13253520 ,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 one actually becomes wise and surrenders unto Him. That is the only way to stop the repetition of birth and death. This is confirmed in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Caitanya-carit\'e4m\'e5ta}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{
\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid11612319 Mad}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid13253520 hya}{\cf1\insrsid11612319  19.151}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ) in the instructions given by \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu to \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 at Da\'e7\'e4\'e7vamedha-gh
\'e4\'f6a.
\par }\pard\plain \s427\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 brahm\'e4\'eb\'f2a bhramite kona bh\'e4gyav\'e4n j\'e9va\line guru-k\'e5\'f1\'eb
a-pras\'e4de p\'e4ya bhakti-lat\'e4-b\'e9ja
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
The living entity wanders throughout different planets in different forms and bodies, but if by chance he comes in contact with a bona fide spiritual master, by the grace of the spiritual master he receives Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
