\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 O My sons, you should accept a highly elevated paramaha\'e0
sa, a spiritually advanced spiritual master. In this way, you should place your faith and love in Me, the S
upreme Personality of Godhead. You should detest sense gratification and tolerate the duality of pleasure and pain, which are like the seasonal changes of summer and winter. Try to realize the miserable condition of living entities, who are miserable even
 
in the higher planetary systems. Philosophically inquire about the truth. Then undergo all kinds of austerities and penances for the sake of devotional service. Give up the endeavor for sense enjoyment and engage in the service of the Lord. Listen to disc
u
ssions about the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and always associate with devotees. Chant about and glorify the Supreme Lord, and look upon everyone equally on the spiritual platform. Give up enmity and subdue anger and lamentation. Abandon identifying t
h
e self with the body and the home, and practice reading the revealed scriptures. Live in a secluded place and practice the process by which you can completely control your life air, mind and senses. Have full faith in the revealed scriptures, the Vedic li
t
eratures, and always observe celibacy. Perform your prescribed duties and avoid unnecessary talks. Always thinking of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, acquire knowledge from the right source. Thus practicing bhakti-yoga, you will patiently and enthusia
stically be elevated in knowledge and will be able to give up the false ego.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 In these four verses, \'c5\'f1
abhadeva tells His sons how they can be freed from the false identification arising from false ego and material conditional life. One gradually beco
mes liberated by practicing as mentioned above. All these prescribed methods enable one to give up the material body (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 li\'ecga\'e0 vyapohet}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
) and be situated in his original spiritual body. First of all one has to accept a bona fide spiritual master. This is advocated by \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 in his }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhakti-ras\'e4m\'e5ta-sindhu:}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7r\'e9-guru-p\'e4d\'e4\'e7raya\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  To be freed from the entanglement of the material world, one has to approach a spiritual master. }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Tad-vij\'ef\'e4n\'e4rtha\'e0 sa gurum ev\'e4bhigacchet.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  By questioning the spiritual master an
d by serving him, one can advance in spiritual life. When one engages in devotional service, naturally the attraction for personal comfort\emdash for eating, sleeping and dressing\emdash 
is reduced. By associating with the devotee, a spiritual standard is maintained. The word }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mad-deva-sa\'ecg\'e4t}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 is very important. There are many so-called religions devoted to the worship of various demigods, but here good association means association with one who simply accepts K\'e5\'f1\'eba as his worshipable Deity.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Another important item is }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 dvandva-titik\'f1
\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  As long as one is situated in the material world, there must be pleasure and pain arising from the material body. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba advises in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 t\'e4\'e0s titik\'f1asva bh\'e4rata.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  One has to learn how to tolerate the temporary pains and pleasures of 
this material world. One must also be detached from his family and practice celibacy. Sex with one's wife according to the scriptural injunctions is also accepted as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahmacarya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 (celibacy), but illicit sex is opposed to religious principles, and it hampers advancement in spiritual consciousness. Another important word is }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 vij\'ef\'e4na-vir\'e4jita.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 Everything should be done very scientifically and consciously. One should be a realized soul. In this way, one can give up the entanglement of material bondage.
\par As \'c7r\'e9 Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya points out, the sum and substance of these four }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7lokas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 is that one should refrain from acting out of a desire for sense gratification and should instead always engage in the Lord's loving service. In other words, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 bhakti-yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 is the acknowledged path of liberation. \'c7r\'e9la Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya quotes from the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Adhy\'e4tma:
\par }\pard\plain \s427\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 \'e4tmano 'vihita\'e0 karma\line varjayitv\'e4nya-karma\'eba\'f9\line k\'e4
masya ca parity\'e4go\line nir\'e9hety \'e4hur uttam\'e4\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
One should perform activities only for the benefit of the soul; any other activity should be given up. Whe
n a person is situated in this way, he is said to be desireless. Actually a living entity cannot be totally desireless, but when he desires the benefit of the soul and nothing else, he is said to be desireless.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Spiritual knowledge is }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 j\'ef\'e4na-vij\'ef
\'e4na-samanvitam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  When one is fully equipped with }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 j\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 vij\'ef\'e4na,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  he is perfect. }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 J\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  means that one understands the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Vi\'f1\'ebu, to be the Supreme Being. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vij\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
