 the chest. The heart is situated within the chest, and although instrumentally the son is born with the aid of the genitals, he is actually born from within the heart. According to the heart's situation}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4025764 , t}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 he }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid1909903 semina}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  takes the form of a body. Therefore according to the Vedic system, when one begets a child his heart should be purified through the ritualistic ceremony known as }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 garbh\'e4dh\'e4na.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  \'c5\'f1abhadeva's heart was always uncontaminated and spiritual. Consequently all the sons born from the heart of \'c5\'f1abhadeva were sp}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid15361423 
iritually inclined. Nonetheless,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  \'c5\'f1abhadeva suggested that His eldest son was superior, and He advised the others to serve him. All the brothers of Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4ja were advised by \'c5\'f1abhadeva to adhere to 
Bharata's service. The question may be asked why one should be attached to family members, for in the beginning it was advised that one should not be attached to home and family. However, it is also advised, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mah\'e9yas
\'e4m p\'e4da-rajo-'bhi\'f1eka}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \emdash one has to serve the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mah\'e9y\'e4n,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  one who is very spiritually advanced. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Mahat-sev\'e4
\'e0 dv\'e4ram \'e4hur vimukte\'f9:}{\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 by serving the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mahat,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  the exalted devotee, one's path for liberation is open. The family of 
\'c5\'f1abhadeva should not be compared to an ordinary materialistic family. Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, \'c5\'f1
abhadeva's eldest son, was specifically very exalted. For this reason the other sons were advised to serve him for his pleasure. That was to be their duty.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 The Supreme Lord was advising Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4
