hira to be the supreme emperor of this planet. He never wanted Duryodhana to take the post. As stated in the previous verse, Lord \'c5\'f1abhadeva's heart is }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 h\'e5daya\'e0 yatra dharma\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 The characteristic }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is also explained in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 surrender unto the Supreme Personality of Godhead. To protect }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 paritr\'e4\'eb\'e4ya s\'e4dh\'fcn\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
), the Lord always wants the ruler of the earth to be a devotee. Then ev
erything goes on nicely for the benefit of everyone. As soon as a demon rules the earth, everything becomes chaotic. At the present moment, the world is inclined toward the democratic process, but the people in general are all contaminated by the modes of
 passion and ignorance. Consequently they cannot select the right person to head the government. The president is selected by the votes of ignorant }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdras;}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  therefore another }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is elected, and immediately the entire government becomes polluted. If people strictly followed the principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 they}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  would elect a person who is the Lord's devotee. Then automatically there would be good government. \'c5\'f1abhadeva therefore recommended Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja as the emperor of this planet. Serving a devotee means serving the Supreme Lord, for a devotee always represents the Lord. When a devotee is in charge, the government is always congenial and beneficial for everyone.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.5.21, SB 5.5.22, SB 5.5.21-22
