 Him. His body was transcendental and consequently did not at all suffer pain. He was always situated in His spiritual bliss. As stated in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 18.61}{
