\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 O King Par\'e9k\'f1it, just to show all the yog\'e9
s the mystic process, Lord \'c5\'f1abhadeva, the partial expansion of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, performed wonderful activities. Actually He was the master of liberation and was fully absorbed in transcendental bliss, which increased a thousandfold. Lord K\'e5
\'f1\'eba, V\'e4sudeva, the son of Vasudeva, is the original source of Lord \'c5\'f1abhadeva. There is no difference in Their constitution, and consequently Lord \'c5\'f1
abhadeva awakened the loving symptoms of crying, laughing and shivering. He was always absorbed in tran
scendental love. Due to this, all mystic powers automatically approached Him, such as the ability to travel in outer space at the speed of mind, to appear and disappear, to enter the bodies of others, and to see things far, far away. Although He could do 
all this, He did not exercise these powers.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
