igion that can free one from material bondage, and He put an end to all kinds of atheistic activities. On this earth, the place known as Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a was a very pious land because the Supreme Lord appeared there when He wanted to incarnate.\line 
Lord \'c5\'f1abhadeva neglected all the mystic powers for which the so-called }{\cs337\i\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s}{\insrsid11612319 
 hanker. Because of the beauty of devotional service, devotees are not at all interested in so-called mystic power. The master of all yogic power, Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, can exhibit all powers on behalf o
