kara\'f9}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash servant; }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 va\'f9}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash of you (the P\'e4\'eb\'f2avas); }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 astu
}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash to be sure; }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 evam}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash thus; }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 a\'ecga}{
