\'e4m}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash of those devotees engaged in service; }{\cs410\i\insrsid11612319\charrsid4273542 mukunda\'f9}{\cs409\fs28\insrsid11612319\charrsid12079977 \emdash the Lord, the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{
