 kissed it out of love. Being attached to raising the deer, Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja Bharata forgot the rules and regulations for the advancement of spiritual life, and he gradually forgot to worship the Supreme Personality of Godhead. After a few days, he forgot everything about his spiritual advancement.
