Due to his being especially gifted with the Lord's mercy, Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4ja could remember the incidents of his past life. Although he received the body of a br\'e4hma\'eb
a, he was still very much afraid of his relatives and friends who were not devotees. He was always very cautious of such association because he feared that he would again fall down. Consequently he manifested himself before the public eye as a madman
\emdash dull, blind and deaf\emdash so that others would not try to talk to him. In this way he saved himself from bad association. Within he was always thinking of the lotus feet of the Lord and chanting the Lord's glories, which save one fr
om the bondage of fruitive action. In this way he saved himself from the onslaught of nondevotee associates.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
Every living entity is bound by different activities due to association with the modes of nature. As stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 k\'e4ra\'eba\'e0 gu\'eb
a-sa\'ecgo 'sya sad-asad-yoni-janmasu:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  "This is due to his association with that material nature. Thus he meets with good and evil among various species." }{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (Bg. 13.22)
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 We get different types of bodies among 8,400,000 species according to our }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Karma\'eb\'e4 daiva-netre\'eba:}{\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
we work under the influence of material nature contaminated by the three modes, and thus we get a certain type of body according to superior order. This is called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma-bandha.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 To get out of this }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma-bandha,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  one must engage himself in devotional service. Then one will not be affected by the modes of material nature.
\par }\pard\plain \s427\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 m\'e4\'e0 ca yo 'vyabhic\'e4re\'eba\line bhakti-yogena sevate\line sa gu\'eb\'e4
