a father's mind was always filled with affection for his son, Ja\'f2a Bharata }{\fs28\insrsid3309342 [}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4ja]. Therefore he was always attached to Ja\'f2a Bharata. Because Ja\'f2a Bharata was unfit to enter the g
\'e5hastha-\'e4\'e7rama, he simply executed the purificatory process up to the end of the brahmacarya-\'e4\'e7rama. Although Ja\'f2a Bharata was unwilling to accept his father's instructions, the br\'e4hma\'eba nonetheless instru
cted him in how to keep clean and how to wash, thinking that the son should be taught by the father.
\par }\pard\plain \s442\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7300536 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Ja\'f2a Bharata was Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4ja in the body of a }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and he outwardly conducted himself as if he were dull, deaf, dumb and blind. Actually 
he was quite alert within. He knew perfectly well of the results of fruitive activity and the results of devotional service. In the body of a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja Bharata was completely absorbed in devotional service within; therefore it was not at all necessary for him to execute the regulative principles of fruitive activity. As confirmed in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam:}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 svanu\'f1\'f6hitasya dharmasya sa\'e0siddhir hari-to\'f1a\'ebam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid548546 (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid3309342 Bh\'e4g.}{
\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid3309342\charrsid3309342  }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11612319\charrsid3309342 1.2.13}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid548546\charrsid3309342 )}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
. One has to satisfy Hari, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. That is the perfection of the regulative principles of fruitive activity. Besides that, it is stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam:
\par }\pard\plain \s427\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 dharma\'f9 svanu\'f1\'f6hita\'f9 pu\'e0s\'e4\'e0\line vi\'f1vaksena-kath\'e4su ya
\'f9\line notp\'e4dayed yadi rati\'e0\line \'e7rama eva hi kevalam
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "Duties }{\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid3309342\charrsid3309342 [}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 dharma}{\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid3309342\charrsid3309342 ]}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  executed by men, regardless of occupation, ar
e only so much useless labor if they do not provoke attraction for the message of the Supreme Lord." }{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid9848435\charrsid9848435 Bh\'e4g.}{\cf1\insrsid11612319  1.2.8)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  These }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  activities are required as long as one has not developed K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. If one is developed in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, t
here is no need to execute the prior regulative principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  \'c7r\'e9la M\'e4dhavendra Pur\'e9 said, "O regulative principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  please excuse me. I cannot follow all these regulative principles, for I am fully engaged in devotional service." He expressed the desire to sit somewhere beneath a tree and continue chanting the Hare K
\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mah\'e4-mantra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Consequently he did not execute all the regulative principles. Similarly, Harid\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura was born in a Mohammedan family. From the very beginning
