tha Cakravart\'e9 \'d6h\'e4kura explains that due to the Brahman effulgence of such a devotee as Ja\'f2
a Bharata, the deity was fractured. Only thieves and rogues in the modes of passion and ignorance and maddened by material opulence offer a man in sacrifice before the goddess K\'e4l\'e9
. This is not sanctioned by the Vedic instructions. Presently there are many hundreds and thousands of slaughterhouses throughout the world that are maintained by a puffed-up population mad for material opulence. Such activities are never supported by t
he }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bh\'e4gavata}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  school.
