\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 
Fatness, thinness, bodily and mental distress, thirst, hunger, fear, disagreement, desires for material happiness, old age, sleep, attachment for material possessions, anger, lamentation, illusion a
nd identification of the body with the self are all transformations of the material covering of the spirit soul. A person absorbed in the material bodily conception is affected by these things, but I am free from all bodily conceptions. Consequently I am 
neither fat nor skinny nor anything else you have mentioned.
\par }\pard\plain \s424\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5396804 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9la Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura has sung: }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 deha-sm\'e5ti n\'e4hi y\'e4ra, sa\'e0s\'e4ra-bandhana k\'e4h\'e4\'ec t\'e4ra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  One who is spiritually advanced has no connection with the body or with the bodily actions and rea
ctions. When one comes to understand that he is not the body and therefore is neither fat nor skinny, one attains the topmost form of spiritual realization. When one is not spiritually realized, the bodily conception entangles one in the material world. A
t the present moment all human society is laboring under the bodily conception; therefore in the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'e4stras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  people in this age are referred to as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
dvipada-pa\'e7u,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  two-legged animals. No one can be happy in a civilization conducted by such animals. Our K\'e5\'f1\'eba consc
iousness movement is trying to raise fallen human society to the status of spiritual understanding. It is not possible for everyone to become immediately self-realized like Ja\'f2a Bharata. However, as stated in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r
\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid13190186  }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid13190186\charrsid9848435 (}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid13190186 1.2.18}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid13190186 )}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 : }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 na\'f1\'f6a-pr\'e4
ye\'f1v abhadre\'f1u nitya\'e0 bh\'e4gavata-sevay\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  By spreading the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bh\'e4gavata}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 principles, we can raise human society to the platform of perfection. When one is not affected by the bodily conceptions, one can advance to the Lord's devotional service.
\par }\pard\plain \s427\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 na\'f1\'f6a-pr\'e4ye\'f1v abhadre\'f1u\line nitya\'e0 bh\'e4gavata-sevay\'e4\line 
bhagavaty uttama\'e7loke\line bhaktir bhavati nai\'f1\'f6hik\'e9\line }{\cs337\i0\insrsid11612319  
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13190186 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
The more we advance our freedom from the bodily conception, the more we are fixed in devotional service, and the more we are happy and peaceful. In this regard, \'c7r\'e9la Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya says t
hat those who are too materially affected continue the bodily conception. Such persons are concerned with different bodily symptoms, whereas one freed from bodily conceptions lives without the body even in the material condition.
