y on the stage under someone else's direction. While we are in the human form, we should put an end to this nonsensical stage performance. We should come to our original constitutional position, known as K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. At the present moment, the real master is material nature. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Daiv\'e9 hy e\'f1\'e4 gu\'eba-may\'e9 mama m\'e4y\'e4 duratyay\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid548546 (}{
