\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  those who are simply attached to the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and who do not understand the purpose of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 or the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  are called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 veda-v\'e4da-rat\'e4\'f9.
\par }\pard\plain \s431\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7886804 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 y\'e4m im\'e4\'e0 pu\'f1pit\'e4\'e0 v\'e4ca\'e0\line pravadanty avipa\'e7cita
\'f9\line veda-v\'e4da-rat\'e4\'f9 p\'e4rtha\line n\'e4nyad ast\'e9ti v\'e4dina\'f9
\par k\'e4m\'e4tm\'e4na\'f9 svarga-par\'e4\line janma-karma-phala-prad\'e4m\line kriy\'e4-vi\'e7e\'f1a-bahul\'e4\'e0\line bhogai\'e7varya-gati\'e0 prati
