The physical elements, nature, the original cause, culture, destiny and the time element are all material causes. Agitated b
y these material causes, the eleven functions transform into hundreds of functions and then into thousands and then into millions. But all these transformations do not take place automatically by mutual combination. Rather, they are under the direction of
 the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11027688 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
One should not think that all the interactions of the physical elements, gross and subtle, that cause the transformation of mind and consciousness are working independently. They are under the direction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In }{
\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 15.15}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), K\'e5\'f1\'eba says that the Lord is situated in everyone's heart (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sarvasya c
\'e4ha\'e0 h\'e5di sannivi\'f1\'f6o matta\'f9 sm\'e5tir j\'ef\'e4nam apohana\'e0 ca}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). As mentioned herein, Supersoul (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 k\'f1etraj\'efa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
) is directing everything. The living entity is also }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 k\'f1etraj\'efa,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  but the supreme }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 k\'f1etraj\'efa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 is the Supreme Personality of Godhead. He is the witness and order giver. Under His direction, everything takes place. The different inclinations of the living entity are created by his own nature or h
is expectations, and he is trained by the Supreme Personality of Godhead through the agency of material nature. The body, nature and the physical elements are under the direction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. They do not function automatically. N
ature is neither independent nor automatic. As confirmed in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  the Supreme Personality of Godhead is behind nature.
\par }\pard\plain \s431\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7886804 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 may\'e4dhyak\'f1e\'eba prak\'e5ti\'f9\line s\'fcyate sa-car\'e4caram\line 
