\par janasya gopt\'e4smi vikattham\'e4no
\par na \'e7obhase v\'e5ddha-sabh\'e4su dh\'e5\'f1\'f6a\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s271\qj \li0\ri0\sb240\sa240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v\fs28\insrsid11612319 SYNONYMS
\par }\pard\plain \s412\qj \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11098997 \f35\fs24\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 \'e7ocy\'e4n}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash lamentable; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 im\'e4n}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash all these; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 tvam}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash you; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 adhi-ka\'f1\'f6a-d\'e9n\'e4n}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
poor persons suffering more pains because of their poverty-stricken position; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 vi\'f1\'f6y\'e4}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash by force; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 nig\'e5h\'eban}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash seizing; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 niranugraha\'f9 asi}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash you have no mercy in your heart; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 janasya}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash of the people in general; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 gopt\'e4 asmi}{
\insrsid11612319 \emdash I am the protector (king); }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 vikattham\'e4na\'f9}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash bragging; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na \'e7obhase}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash you do not look very good; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 v\'e5ddha-sabh\'e4su}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash in the society of learned persons; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 dh\'e5\'f1\'f6a\'f9}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash simply impudent.
\par }\pard\plain \s451\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15405877 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 
It is a fact, however, that these innocent people carrying your pala
nquin without payment are certainly suffering due to this injustice. Their condition is very lamentable because you have forcibly engaged them in carrying your palanquin. This proves that you are cruel and unkind, yet due to false prestige you were thinki
ng that you were protecting the citizens. This is ludicrous. You were such a fool that you could not have been adored as a great man in an assembly of persons advanced in knowledge.
\par }\pard\plain \s451\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15405877 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 King Rah\'fcga\'eba was proud of being king, and he felt he had the right
 to control the citizens as he liked, but actually he was engaging men in carrying his palanquin without payment, and therefore he was causing them trouble without reason. Nonetheless, the King was thinking that he was the protector of the citizens. Actua
lly the king should be the representative of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. For this reason he is called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 nara-devat\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 the Lord among human beings. However, when a king thinks that because he is the head of the state, he can utilize the citizens for his
 sense gratification, he is in error. Such an attitude is not appreciated by learned scholars. According to the Vedic principles, the king should be advised by learned sages, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 and scholars, who advise him according to the injunctions given in the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 dharma-\'e7\'e4stra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 The duty of the king is to follow these instructions. Learned circles do not appreciate the king's utilizing public endeavor for his own benefit. His duty is to give protection to the citizens instead. The king should not become such a rogue
 that he exploits the citizens for his own benefit.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 It is stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  that in Kali-yuga the heads of government will be plunderers and thieves. These thieves and plunderers take the money and property of the public by force or connivance. Therefore it is said in }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, r\'e4janyair nirgh\'e5\'ebair dasyu-dharmabhi\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 As Kali-yuga advances, we can see that these characteristics are already visible. We can certainly imagine how deteriorated human civilization will be by the end of Kali-yuga.
 Indeed, there will no longer be a sane man capable of understanding God and our relationship with Him. In other words, human beings will be just like animals. At that time, in order to reform human society, Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a will come in the form of the Kalki }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 avat\'e4ra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  His business will be to kill all the atheists because ultimately the real protector is Vi\'f1\'ebu, or K\'e5\'f1\'eba.
\par The Lord incarnates and sets things in order when things are mismanaged by so-called kings and heads of government. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yad\'e4 yad\'e4 hi dharmasya gl\'e4nir bhavati bh\'e4rata.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 Of course this takes many years, but the principle is there. When the king or governmental head does not follow the proper principles, nature deals out the punishments in the forms of war, famine and so for
th. Therefore if the governmental head is not aware of life's goal, he should not take charge of ruling the people. Actually the supreme proprietor of everything is Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u. He is the maintainer of everyone. The king, the father, and the guardian are simply representatives of Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u, empowered by Him to look after the management and maintain things. It is therefore the duty of the head of the state to maintain the general populace in such a way that people will ultimately know the goal of life. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
Na te vidu\'f9 sv\'e4rtha-gati\'e0 hi vi\'f1\'ebum.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Unfortunately the foolish governmental head and the general populace do not know that the ultimate goal of life is to understand and approach Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u. Without this knowledge, everyone is in ignorance, and all society is crowded with cheaters and cheated.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.12.8
\par }\pard\plain \s275\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13252452 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TEXT 8
