Since this universe has no real ultimate existence, the things within it\emdash shortness, differences, grossness, skinniness, smallness, bigness, result, cause, living symptoms, and materials\emdash 
are all imagined. They are all pots made of the same substance, earth, but they are named differently. The differences are characterized by the substance, nature, predisposition, time and activity. You should know that all these are
 simply mechanical manifestations created by material nature.
\par }\pard\plain \s451\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15405877 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
The temporary manifestations and varieties within this material world are simply creations of material nature under various circumstances: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 prak\'e5te\'f9 }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid12809039\charrsid12809039 kriyam\'e4
\'eb\'e4ni}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  gu\'ebai\'f9 karm\'e4\'ebi sarva\'e7a\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  T
he actions and reactions carried out by the material nature are sometimes accepted as our scientific inventions; therefore we want to take credit for them and defy the existence of God. This is described in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g
\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 3.27}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 aha\'eck\'e4ra-vim\'fc\'f2h\'e4tm\'e4 kart\'e4ham iti manyate:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 due to being covered by the illusory external energy, the living entity tries to take credit for the differentiated creations within the material world. Actually all these are being created automatically by the material force set in motion b
y the energy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Therefore the ultimate cause is the Supreme Person. As stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Brahma-sa\'e0hit\'e4:
\par }\pard\plain \s455\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2052598 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs454\cf1\insrsid11612319\charrsid9460468 \'e9\'e7vara\'f9 parama\'f9 k\'e5\'f1\'eba\'f9\line 
sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha\'f9\line an\'e4dir \'e4dir govinda\'f9\line sarva-k\'e4ra\'eba-k\'e4ra\'ebam}{\insrsid11612319 
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 He is the cause of all causes, the ultimate cause. In this regard \'c7r\'e9
la Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya says: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 eva\'e0 sarva\'e0 tath\'e4 prak\'e5tvayai kalpita\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebor anyat}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid2052598 .}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4025764  e}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 va\'e0 prak
\'e5ty\'e4dh\'e4ra\'f9 svayam anany\'e4dh\'e4ro vi\'f1\'ebur eva}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid2052598 .}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  ata\'f9 sarva-\'e7abd\'e4\'e7 ca tasminn eva.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Actually the original cause is Lord Vi\'f1
\'ebu, but out of ignorance people think that matter is the cause of everything.
\par }\pard\plain \s431\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7886804 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 r\'e4j\'e4 gopt\'e4\'e7rayo bh\'fcmi\'f9\line \'e7ara\'eba\'e0 ceti laukika
\'f9\line vyavah\'e4ro na tat satya\'e0\line tayor brahm\'e4\'e7rayo vibhu\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
Things are contemplated on the ephemeral or external platform, but actually this is not the truth. The actual protector and shelter of everyone is Brahman, the Supreme, not the king.
