\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahma\'ebo hi prati\'f1\'f6h\'e4ham}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (Bg. 14.27)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 . On Brahman, everything is resting. All the universes are resting on the }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahmajyoti,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 and all the planets are resting on the universal atmosphere. In each and every planet there are oceans, hills, states and kingdoms, and each planet is giving shelter to so many living entities. They a
re all standing on the earth of feet and legs, torso and shoulders, but actually everything is resting ultimately on the potencies of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Therefore He is known ultimately as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sarva-k\'e4ra
\'eba-k\'e4ra\'ebam,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  the cause of all causes.
