{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 etat}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash this knowledge; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 tapas\'e4}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash by severe austerities and penances; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na y\'e4ti}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
does not become revealed; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash not; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ca}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash also; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ijyay\'e4}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
by a great arrangement for worshiping the Deity; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 nirvapa\'eb\'e4t}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash or from finishing all material duties and accepting }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 sanny\'e4sa;}{\insrsid11612319  }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 g\'e5h\'e4t}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash from ideal householder life; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 v\'e4}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash or; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash nor; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 chandas\'e4}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash by observing celibacy or studying Vedic literature; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na eva}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash nor; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 jala-agni-s\'fcryai\'f9}{
\insrsid11612319 \emdash by severe austerities such as keeping oneself in water, in a burning fire or in the scorching sun; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 vin\'e4}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash without; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 mahat}{\insrsid11612319 
\emdash of the great devotees; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 p\'e4da-raja\'f9}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash the dust of the lotus feet; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 abhi\'f1ekam}{\insrsid11612319 \emdash smearing all over the body.
\par }\pard\plain \s451\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15405877 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 My dear King Rah\'fcga\'eb
a, unless one has the opportunity to smear his entire body with the dust of the lotus feet of great devotees, one cannot realize the Absolute Truth. One cannot realize the Absolute Truth simply by observing celibacy }{\fs28\insrsid3041504 [}{
\fs28\insrsid11612319 brahmacarya], strictly following the rules and regulations of householder life, leaving home as a v\'e4naprastha, accepting sanny\'e4sa, or undergoing severe penances in win
ter by keeping oneself submerged in water or surrounding oneself in summer by fire and the scorching heat of the sun. There are many other processes to understand the Absolute Truth, but the Absolute Truth is only revealed to one who has attained the merc
y of a great devotee.
\par }\pard\plain \s451\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15405877 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
Actual knowledge of transcendental bliss can be bestowed upon anyone by a pure devotee. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vede\'f1u durlabham adurlabham \'e4tma-bhaktau.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 One cannot attain the perfection of spiritual life simply by following the directions of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vedas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  One has to approach a pure devotee: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 any\'e4bhil\'e4
\'f1it\'e4-\'e7\'fcnya\'e0 j\'ef\'e4na-karm\'e4dy-an\'e4v\'e5tam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  By the grace of such a devotee, one can understand the Absolute Truth, K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, and one's relationship with Him. A materialistic person sometimes thinks that simply by execut
ing pious activities and remaining at home one can understand the Absolute Truth. That is denied in this verse. Nor can one understand the Absolute Truth simply by observing the rules and regulations of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahmacarya}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (celibacy). One only has to serve the pure devotee. That will help one understand the Absolute Truth without fail.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.12.13
