 kahibe:}{\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 one should not indulge in talking unnecessarily about ne
ws of the material world. One should not waste time in this way. This is a very important feature in the life of a devotee. A devotee has no other ambition than to serve K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. This K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement was started to engage people twenty-four hours daily in the service of the Lord and in His glorification. The students in this institution engage in the cultivation of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness from five in the morning to ten at night. They actually have no opportunity to waste their time unnecessarily by discussing politics, sociology and current events. These will go their own way. A devotee is concerned only with serving K\'e5
\'f1\'eba positively and seriously.
