ns on the mountain. Being pricked by them, he becomes very aggrieved. Sometimes a person who is very attached to his family becomes overwhelmed with hunger, and due to his miserable condition he becomes furious with his family members.
\par }\pard\plain \s451\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15405877 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 The ambitiou
s conditioned soul wants to be very happy in this material world with his family, but he is compared to a traveler in the forest who desires to climb a hill full of thorns and small stones. As stated in the previous verse, the happiness derived from socie
ty, friendship and love is like a drop of water in the scorching heat of the desert. One may want to become very great and powerful in society, but this is like attempting to climb a hill full of thorns. \'c7r\'e9la Vi\'e7van\'e4tha Cakravart\'e9 \'d6h
\'e4kura compares one's fa
mily to high mountains. Becoming happy in their association is like a hungry man's endeavoring to climb a mountain full of thorns. Almost 99.9 percent of the population is unhappy in family life, despite all the attempts being made to satisfy the family m
e
mbers. In the Western countries, due to the dissatisfaction of the family members, there is actually no family life. There are many cases of divorce, and out of dissatisfaction, the children leave the protection of their parents. Especially in this age of
 Kali, family life is being reduced. Everyone is becoming self-centered because that is the law of nature. Even if one has sufficient money to maintain a family, the situation is such that no one is happy in family life. Consequently according to the }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  institution, one has to retire from family life in middle age: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 pa\'efc\'e4\'e7ordhva\'e0 vana\'e0 vrajet.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 One should voluntarily retire from family life at the age of fifty and go to V\'e5nd\'e4vana or a forest. This is recommended by \'c7r\'e9la Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid9848435\charrsid9848435 (Bh\'e4g.}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11612319  }
