\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash in the forest of material life; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 gata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash having entered; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash not; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 
adya api}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash until now; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 viphala}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash unsuccessful; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 bahu-pratiyoga}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash full of great dif
ficulties and varieties of miserable conditions; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 \'e9ha\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash whose activities here in this material world; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 tat-t\'e4pa-upa\'e7a-man\'e9m}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 
