whose symptoms are worship of the Supreme Lord by performance of sacrifices and so on; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash which; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 asau}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash that; }{
