\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 s\'e4mpar\'e4ye}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash for the benefit of the living entity after death; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ud\'e4haranti}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the wise declare; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 
tat-dharmyam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash religious (relating to the prosecution of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 ); }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 dhanam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash wealth; }{
