a can be saved from the cruel hands of material nature. The conditioned soul, however, sometimes wants to take shelter of a demigod, man-made god, pseudo incarnation or bogus }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sv\'e4m\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  or }
{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  All these cheaters claim to follow religious principles, and all this has become very popular in this age of Kali. There are many }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 p\'e4\'f1a\'eb
\'f2\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  who, without referring to the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'e4stras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  pose themselves as incarnations, and foolish people follow them. K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, has left behind Him }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
