\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement is trying its best to bring people back to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness in its pure form, but the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 p\'e4\'f1a\'eb\'f2\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
