ja Bharata was so attracted to K\'e5\'f1\'eba that he gave up all his material possessions. Generally materialistic people are attracted by such possessions.
\par }\pard\plain \s293\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9320371 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ato g\'e5ha-k\'f1etra-sut\'e4pta-vittair\line janasya moho 'yam aha\'e0
 mameti\line }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid9848435\charrsid9848435 (Bh\'e4g.}{\cs337\i0\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\i0\cf1\insrsid11612319\charrsid9320371 5.5.8}{\i0\cf1\insrsid548546\charrsid9320371 )}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 
