the resting place of the innumerable living entities (}{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 nara}{\fs28\insrsid11612319  means the living entities, and }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ayana}{\fs28\insrsid11612319  means the shelter); }{
