 are meant for the understanding of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma, j\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \emdash fruitive activity, speculative knowledge and mystic }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Whatever way of spiritual realization we accept, the ultimate goal is N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The living entities are eternally connected with Him via devotional service. As stated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, ante n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba-sm\'e5ti\'f9:}{
\cs337\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 the perfection of life is to remember N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba at the time of death. Although Bharata Mah\'e4r\'e4ja had to accept the body of a deer, he could remember N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a at the time of death. Consequently he took birth as a perfect devotee in a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  family. This confirms the statement of }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 6.41}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7uc\'e9n\'e4\'e0 \'e7r\'e9mat\'e4\'e0 gehe yoga-bhra\'f1\'f6o 'bhij\'e4yate:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 "One who falls from the path of self-realization takes birth in a family of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  or wealthy aristocrats." Although Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Bharata appeared in the royal family, he
 became neglectful and took birth as a deer. Because he was very cautious within his deer body, he took birth in a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  family as Ja\'f2
a Bharata. During this lifetime, he remained perfectly K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious and preached the gospel of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness directly, beginning with his instructions to Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Rah\'fcga\'eba. In this regard, the word }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e4ya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is very significant. The purpose of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 a\'f1\'f6\'e4\'ecga-yoga,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  as stated by Madhv\'e4c\'e4
rya, is to link or connect with the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The goal is not to display some material perfections.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.14.46
