\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf9\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9la \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 continued: }{
\fs28\insrsid11612319 The son of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Bharata known as Sumati followed the path of \'c5\'f1a
bhadeva, but some unscrupulous people imagined him to be Lord Buddha himself. These people, who were actually atheistic and of bad character, took up the Vedic principles in an imaginary, infamous way to support their activities. Thus these sinful people 
accepted Sumati as Lord Buddhadeva and propagated the theory that everyone should follow the principles of Sumati. In this way they were carried away by mental concoction.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8459427 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Those who are \'c4ryans strictly follow the Vedic principles, but in this age of
 Kali a community has sprung up known as the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e4rya-sam\'e4ja,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  which is ignorant of the import of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  in the }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 parampar\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  system. Their leaders decry all bona fide }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e4c\'e4ryas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 and they pose themselves as the real followers of the Vedic principles. These }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e4c\'e4ryas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  who do not follow the Vedic principles are presently known as the }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e4rya-sam\'e4jas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 or the Jains. Not only do they not follow the Vedic principles, but they have no relationship with Lord Buddha. Imitating the behavior of Sumati, they claim to be the descendants of \'c5\'f1abhadeva. Those who are Vai\'f1\'eb
avas carefully avoid their company because they are ignorant of the path of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vedas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  In }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{
\cf1\insrsid11612319 15.15}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ) K\'e5\'f1\'eba says, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 vedai\'e7 ca sarvair aham eva vedya\'f9:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  "The real purpose of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Vedas}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is to understand Me." This is the injunction of all Vedic literatures. One who does not know the greatness of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba cannot be accepted as an \'c4ryan. Lord Buddha, an incarnation of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, adopted a particular means to propagate the philosophy of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 bh\'e4gavata-dharma.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  He preached 
almost exclusively among atheists. Atheists do not want any God, and Lord Buddha therefore said that there is no God, but he adopted the means to instruct his followers for their benefit. Therefore he preached in a duplicitous way, saying that there is no
 God. Nonetheless, he himself was an incarnation of God.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.15.2
