\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf9\insrsid11612319 \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 said:}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 
 My dear King, Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, the enjoyer of all sacrifices, appeared as V\'e4manadeva in the sacrificial arena of Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja. Then He extended His left foot to the end of the universe and pierced a hole in its covering 
with the nail of His big toe. Through the hole, the pure water of the Causal Ocean entered this universe as the Ganges River. Having washed the lotus feet of the Lord, which are covered with reddish powder, the water of the Ganges acquired a very beautifu
l
 pink color. Every living being can immediately purify his mind of material contamination by touching the transcendental water of the Ganges, yet its waters remain ever pure. Because the Ganges directly touches the lotus feet of the Lord before descending
 within this universe, she is known as Vi\'f1\'ebupad\'e9. Later she received other names like J\'e4hnav\'e9 and Bh\'e4g\'e9rath\'e9
. After one thousand millenniums, the water of the Ganges descended on Dhruvaloka, the topmost planet in this universe. Therefore all learned sages and scholars proclaim Dhruvaloka to be Vi\'f1\'ebupada }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid3347243 [}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "situated on Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu's lotus feet"}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid3347243 ]}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 .
