\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4ja maintained himself in that devotional ecstasy, and \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu also gave us a practical example of transcendental ecstasy when He lived at Jagann\'e4tha Pur\'e9
. His pastimes there are fully narrated in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Caitanya-carit\'e4m\'e5ta.
