\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 From that Supreme Personality of Godhead appears Lord Brahm\'e4
, whose body is made from the total material energy, the reservoir of intelligence predominated by the passionate mode of material nature. From Lord Brahm\'e4
, I myself am born as a representation of false ego known as Rudra. By my own power I create all the other demigods, the five el
ements and the senses. Therefore, I worship the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is greater than any of us and under whose control are situated all the demigods, material elements and senses, and even Lord Brahm\'e4
 and I myself, like birds bound by a rope. Only by the Lord's grace can we create, maintain and annihilate the material world. Therefore I offer my respectful obeisances unto the Supreme Being.
\par }\pard\plain \s440\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12861300 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 A summary of creation is given in this verse. From Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, Mah\'e4
-Vi\'f1\'ebu expands, and from Mah\'e4-Vi\'f1\'ebu, Garbhodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu expands. Lord Brahm\'e4, who was born of Garbhodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu, fathers Lord \'c7iva, from whom all the other demigods gradually evolve. Lord Brahm\'e4
, Lord \'c7iva and Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu are incarnations of the different material qualities. Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu is actually above all material qualities, but He accepts control of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sattva-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 (the mode of goodness) to maintain the universe. Lord Brahm\'e4 is born from the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mahat-tattva.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Brahm\'e4 creates the entire universe, Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu maintains it, and Lord \'c7iva an
nihilates it. The Supreme Personality of Godhead controls all the most important demigods\emdash especially Lord Brahm\'e4 and Lord \'c7iva\emdash 
exactly as the owner of a bird controls it by binding it with a rope. Sometimes vultures are controlled in this way.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.17.24
