"Devotees always engaged in the service of the toes of the Lord's lotus feet can very easily become free from hard-knotted desires for fruitive activities. Because this is very difficult, the nondevotees\emdash the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 j
\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yog\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
