One cannot stop the repetition of birth and death without being completely desireless. Therefore \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 describes pure }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 bhakti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (devotional service) as follows:

\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7159422 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 any\'e4bhil\'e4\'f1it\'e4-\'e7\'fcnya\'e0\line j\'ef\'e4na-karm\'e4dy-an\'e4v
