mahattvam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash greatness; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 vayas\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash by age; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 dam-pat\'e9n\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash of the husband and wife.
