 means affection as well as illusion. When a mother deals with her child affectionately, she is called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 m\'e4y\'e4maya.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  In whatever form the Supreme Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u appears, He is always affectionate toward His devotees. Thus the word }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 m\'e4y\'e4mayam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is used here to mean "very affectionate toward the devotees." \'c7r\'e9la J\'e9va Gosv\'e4m\'e9
