hus become a complete and perfect devotee of the Lord. One may chant this }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 for complete liberation from material bondage, and after liberation one may continue to chant it while worshiping the Supreme Lord in Vaiku\'eb\'f6haloka. All }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mantras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  of course, ar
e meant for this life and the next life, as K\'e5\'f1\'eba Himself confirms in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 9.14}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ):
