\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 
My dear Lord, You are certainly the fully independent master of all the senses. Therefore all women who worship You by strictly observing vows because they wish to acquire a husband to satisfy their senses are surely under illusion. They do not know 
that such a husband cannot actually give protection to them or their children. Nor can he protect their wealth or duration of life, for he himself is dependent on time, fruitive results and the modes of nature, which are all subordinate to You.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3101256 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 In this verse, Lak\'f1m\'e9dev\'e9 (Ram\'e4
) shows compassion toward women who worship the Lord for the benediction of possessing a good husband. Although such women desire to be happy with children, wealth, a long duration of life and everything dear to them, they canno
t possibly do so. In the material world, a so-called husband is dependent on the control of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. There are many examples of a woman whose husband, being dependent on the result of his own fruitive actions, cannot maintain hi
s wife, her children, her wealth or her duration of life. Therefore, factually the only real husband of all women is K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the supreme husband. Because the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 gop\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 were liberated souls, they understood this fact. Therefore they rejected their material husbands and accepted K\'e5\'f1\'eba as their real husband. K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the real husband not only of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 gop\'e9s,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  but of every living entity. Everyone should perfectly understand that K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the real husband of all living entities, who are described in the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 prak\'e5ti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (female), not }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 puru\'f1a}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (male). In }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t
\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 10.12}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), only K\'e5\'f1\'eba is addressed as }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 puru\'f1a:
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3101256 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 para\'e0 brahma para\'e0 dh\'e4ma\line pavitra\'e0 parama\'e0 bhav\'e4n\line 
puru\'f1a\'e0 \'e7\'e4\'e7vata\'e0 divyam\line \'e4di-devam aja\'e0 vibhum
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "You are the Supreme Brahman, the ultimate, the supreme abode a
