, a material expansion of the goddess of fortune, not by Lak\'f1m\'e9dev\'e9 herself. Those who desire material wealth worship Durg\'e4dev\'e9 with the following }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mantra:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{
