\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  When a devotee acquires unparalleled opulences, they are the direct gifts of the goddess of fortune, who resides in the heart of N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 The material opulences a person obtains by offering prayers to the goddess Durg
