 dance, the Lord showed His favor to the most fortunate }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 gop\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  by placing His arms on their shoulders and dancing with each of them individually. No one can compare with the }{
