\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 sa\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash He; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 \'e9\'e7vara\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the supreme controller; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 tvam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash You; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash who; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 idam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash this; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 va\'e7e}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash under control; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 anayat}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash has brought; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 n\'e4mn\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash by different names like }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{
\fs28\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdra;}{\fs28\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 yath\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash exactly like; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 d\'e4rumay\'e9m}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 
\emdash made of wood; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 nara\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash a man; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 striyam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash a doll.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid155618 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 
My dear Lord, just as a puppeteer controls his dancing dolls and a husband controls his wife, Your Lordship controls all the living entities in the universe, such as the br\'e4hma\'ebas, k\'f1atriyas, vai\'e7yas and \'e7\'fcdras. Although You are in
 everyone's heart as the supreme witness and commander and are outside everyone as well, the so-called leaders of societies, communities and countries cannot realize You. Only those who hear the vibration of the Vedic mantras can appreciate You.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid155618 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 The Supreme Personality of Godhead is }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
antarbahi\'f9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  present within and without everything. One must overcome the delusion caused by the Lord's external energy and realize His presence both externally and internally. In }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9
mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (1.8.19)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  \'c7r\'e9mat\'e9 Kunt\'e9dev\'e9 has explained that K\'e5\'f1\'eba appears in this world }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 na\'f6o n\'e4\'f6
yadharo yath\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  "exactly like an actor dressed as a player." In }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 18.61}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ) K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a says, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e9\'e7vara\'f9 sama-bh\'fct\'e4n\'e4\'e0 h\'e5d-de\'e7e 'rjuna ti\'f1\'f6hati:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  "The Supreme Lord is situated in everyone's heart, O
 Arjuna." The Lord is situated within everyone's heart, and outside as well. Within the heart He is the Supersoul, the incarnation who acts as the adviser and witness. Yet although God is residing within their hearts, foolish people say, "I cannot see God
. Please show Him to me."
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
Everyone is under the control of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, exactly like dancing dolls controlled by a puppeteer or a woman controlled by her husband. A woman is compared to a doll (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 d\'e4rumay\'e9}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ) because she has no independence. She should always be controlled by a man. Still, due to false prestige, a class of women wants to remain independent. What to speak of women, all living entities are }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 prak\'e5ti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (female) and therefore dependent on the Supreme Lord, as K\'e5\'f1\'eba Himself explains in }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 apareyam itas tv any\'e4\'e0 prak\'e5ti\'e0 viddhi me par\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
). The living entity is never independent. Under all circumstances, he is dependent on the mercy of the Lord. The Lord creates the social divisions of human society\emdash }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'ebas, k\'f1atriyas, vai\'e7yas}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
and ordains that they follow rules and regulations suited to their particular position. In this way, all members of society remain always under the Supreme Lord's control. Still, some people foolishly deny the existence of God.
\par Self-realiza
tion means to understand one's subordinate position in relation to the Lord. When one is thus enlightened, he surrenders to the Supreme Personality of Godhead and is liberated from the clutches of the material energy. In other words, unless one surrenders
 to the lotus feet of the Lord, the material energy in its many varieties will continue to control him. No one in the material world can deny that he is under control. The Supreme Lord, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a, who is beyond this material existence, controls everyone. The following Vedic }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  confirms this point: }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 eko ha vai n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba \'e4s\'e9t.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Foolish persons think N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba to be on the platform of ordinary material existence. Because they do not realize the natural constitutional position of the living entity, they concoct names like }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 daridra-n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, sv\'e4mi-n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  or }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mithy\'e4-n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  However, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a is actually the supreme controller of everyone. This understanding is self-realization.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.18.27
\par }\pard\plain \s275\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13252452 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TEXT 27
