\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash whatever; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 atra}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash within this material world; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 d\'e5\'e7yate}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash is visible.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5522556 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 My Lord, from the great leaders of the universe, such as Lord Brahm
\'e4 and other demigods, down to the political leaders of this world, all are envious of Your authority. Without Your help, however, they could neither separately nor concertedly maintain the innumerable living entities within the unive
rse. You are actually the only maintainer of all human beings, of animals like cows and asses, and of plants, reptiles, birds, mountains and whatever else is visible within this material world.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5522556 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 It is fashionable for materialistic persons to compete
 with the power of God. When so-called scientists try to manufacture living entities in their laboratories, their only purpose is to defy the talent and ability of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. This is called illusion. It exists even in the higher p
lanetary systems, where great demigods like Lord Brahm\'e4, Lord \'c7
iva and others reside. In this world everyone is puffed up with false prestige despite the failure of all his endeavors. When so-called philanthropists, who supposedly want to help the poor, are approached by members of the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement, they say, "You are simply wasting your time, while I am feeding vast masses of starving people." Unfortunately, their meager efforts, either singly or together, do not solve anyone's problems.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Sometimes so-called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sv\'e4m\'e9s}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  are very eager to feed poor people, thinking them to be }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 daridra-n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  the Lord's incarnations as beggars. They prefer to serve the manufactured }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 daridra-n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  than the original, supreme N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba. They say, "Don't encourage service to Lord N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a. It is better to serve the starving people of the world." Unfortunately such materialists, either singly or combined in the form of the United Nations, cannot fulfill their plans. The truth is that the many millions of human beings, a
nimals, birds and trees\emdash indeed, all living entities\emdash are maintained solely by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Eko bah\'fcn\'e4\'e0 yo vidadh\'e4ti k\'e4m\'e4n:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 one person, the Supreme Lord, is supplying the necessities of life for all other living entities. To challenge the authority of N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, is the business of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 asuras}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (demons). Yet sometimes }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 suras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 or devotees, are also bewildered by the illusory energy and falsely claim to be the maintainer of the entire universe. Such incidents are described in the Tenth Canto of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  where \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 tells how Lord Brahm\'e4 and King Indra became puffed up and were eventually chastised by K\'e5\'f1\'eba.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.18.28
\par }\pard\plain \s275\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13252452 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 TEXT 28
