\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the material elements air, fire, water and earth; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 aindriyam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash all the senses; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 dyau\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
