\'e9pa}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the islands; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 graha-\'e5k\'f1a}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the stars and planets; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 iti}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash thus; }{
