sopher is always interrupted when he dies, and the laws of nature go on without regard for his work.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
For billions of years changes take place in the material creation, until at last the whole universe is dissolved and remains in an unmanifested state. Constant change and destruction (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid666048 bh\'fctv\'e4 bh\'fctv\'e4 pral\'e9
yate}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ) is perpetually going on in nature, yet the material scientists want to study natural laws without knowing the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is the background of nature. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba states in }{
\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 9.10}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ):
