the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 v\'e4sudeva\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the all-pervading Lord; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash not; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 str\'e9-k\'e5
tam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash obtained because of His wife; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ka\'e7malam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash sufferings of separation; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 a\'e7nuv\'e9ta}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
