\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid11612319 Since Lord \'c7r\'e9 R\'e4
macandra is the Supreme Personality of Godhead, V\'e4sudeva, He is not attached to anything in this material world. He is the most bel
oved Supersoul of all self-realized souls, and He is their very intimate friend. He is full of all opulences. Therefore He could not possibly have suffered because of separation from His wife, nor could He have given up His wife and Lak\'f1ma\'eb
a, His younger brother. To give up either would have been absolutely impossible.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14305398 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
In defining the Supreme Personality of Godhead, we say that He is full in all six opulences\emdash wealth, fame, strength, influence, beauty and renunciation. He is called renounced because 
He is not attached to anything in this material world; He is specifically attached to the spiritual world and the living entities there. The affairs of the material world take place under the superintendence of Durg\'e4dev\'e9 (}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 s\'e5\'f1\'f6i-sthiti-pralaya-s\'e4dhana-\'e7aktir ek\'e4/ ch\'e4yeva yasya bhuvan\'e4ni bibharti durg\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
). Everything is going on under the strict rules and regulations of the material energy, represented by Durg\'e4. Therefore the Lord is completely detached and need not give attention to the material world. S\'e9t\'e4dev\'e9
 belongs to the spiritual world. Similarly, Lord Lak\'f1ma\'eba, R\'e4macandra's younger brother, is a manifestation of Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, and Lord R\'e4macandra Himself is V\'e4sudeva, the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Since the Lord is always spiritually qualified, He is a
