e is specifically manifest to those who are self-realized, and He is especially dear to the hearts of His transcendental devotees. Because Lord R\'e4
macandra descended to teach human society how dutiful a king should be, He apparently gave up the company of mother S\'e9t\'e4 and Lak\'f1ma\'eb
a. Factually, however, He could not have given them up. One should therefore learn about the activities of Lord R\'e4macandra from a self-realized soul. Then one can understand the transcendental activities of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.19.7
