\'e4m abhij\'e4n\'e4ti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). One's devotion and sincere desire to serve the Supreme Personality of Godhead are the only qualifications. R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 has also said that the price for ac
hieving God's favor is simply one's sincere eagerness to have it (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 laulyam eka\'e0 m\'fclyam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). In the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Caitanya-bh\'e4gavata}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 it is said:
