}{\fs28\cf9\insrsid13829088 ]}{\fs28\insrsid11612319  The glories of the Supreme Personality of Godhead are inconceivable. He has appeared in the form of Nara-N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba in the land of Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a, at the place known as Badarik\'e4\'e7
rama, to favor His devotees by teaching them religion, knowledge, renunciation, spiritual power, sense control and freedom from false ego. He is advanced in the opulence of
 spiritual assets, and He engages in executing austerity until the end of this millennium. This is the process of self-realization.
\par }\pard\plain \s471\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11545696 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
