\'e7rama just to learn how the Supreme Personality of Godhead in His incarnation as Nara-N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a engages in austerities to teach the people of the world how to achieve self-realization. It is impossible to realize oneself simply by absorbing oneself in speculation and material activities. One must be very se
rious about self-realization and the practice of austerity. Unfortunately, the people of this age of Kali do not even know the meaning of austerity. Under these circumstances, the Lord has appeared as \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4
prabhu to bestow upon the fallen souls the easiest method of self-realization, technically called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ceto-darpa\'eba-m\'e4rjanam,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 cleansing of the dirt from the core of one's heart. This method is extremely simple. Anyone can chant the glorious }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 k\'e5\'f1\'eba-sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \emdash Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1
\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4
ma, Hare Hare. In this age there are different forms of so-called advanced scientific knowledge, such as anthropology, Marxism, Freudianism, nationalism and industrialism, but if we work very hard under their guidance in
stead of adopting the process practiced by Nara-N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, we shall waste our valuable human form of life. Thus we shall certainly be cheated and misled.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.19.10
