\'e4rada has very vividly described how to work to achieve the ultimate goal of life\emdash devotion\emdash through knowledge and through execution of t
he mystic yoga system. He has also described the glories of the Lord, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The great sage N\'e4rada instructed the tenets of this transcendental literature to S\'e4var\'ebi Manu in order to teach those inhabitants of Bh\'e4
rata-var\'f1a who strictly follow the principles of var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma how to achieve the devotional service of the Lord. Thus N\'e4rada Muni, along with the other inhabitants of Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a, always engages in the service of Nara-N\'e4r
\'e4ya\'eba, and he chants as follows.
\par }\pard\plain \s471\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11545696 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
