purpose of life and the method for achieving success are evident. People should take advantage of the opportunity afforded by Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a, and this is especially so for those who are following the principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  If we do not take to the principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  by accepting the four social orders (}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7\'fcdra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ) and the four orders of spiritual life (}{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 brahmac\'e4r\'e9, g\'e5hastha, v\'e4naprastha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sanny\'e4sa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ), there can be no question of success in life. Unfortunately, 
because of the influence of Kali-yuga, everything is now being lost. The inhabitants of Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a are gradually becoming degraded }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mlecchas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
yavanas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  How then will they teach others? Therefore, this K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement has been started not only for the inhabitants of Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a but for all the people of the world, as announced by \'c7r\'e9
 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu. There is still time, and if the inhabitants of Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a take this movement of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness seriously, the entire world will be saved from gliding down to a hellish condition. The K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement follows the process of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 pa\'efcar\'e4trika-vidhi}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  and that of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 bh\'e4gavata-vidhi}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 simultaneously, so that people can take advantage of the movement and make their lives successful.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.19.11
