 and studying all the Vedic literature, one is afraid of giving up his bad body, which is the cause of all his suffering, what is the use of his attempts to advance in spiritual life? The secret of success in practicing }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  is to become free from bodily attachments. \'c7r\'e9la Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura says, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 deha-sm\'e5ti n\'e4hi y\'e4ra, sa\'e0s\'e4ra-bandhana k\'e4
h\'e4\'ec t\'e4ra:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  one whose practice has freed him from the anxieties of bodily needs is no longer in conditional life. Such a person is freed from conditional bondage. A person in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness must fully discharge his devotional duties without material attachment. Then his liberation is guaranteed.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.19.15
