\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 man-man\'e4 bhava mad-bhakto mad-y\'e4j\'e9 m\'e4\'e0 namaskuru.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  The perfect }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 system consists of always thinking of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, always engaging in devotional service, always worshiping K\'e5\'f1\'eba and always offering obeisances unto Him. Unless we practice this }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  system, our illusory attachment for this bad body, which is full of stool and urine, is impossible to give up. The perfection of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 consists of giving up attachment for this body and bodily relationships and transferring that attachment to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. We are very attached to material enjoyment, but when we transfer that same attachment to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, we traverse the path of liberation. One has to practice this }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  system and none other.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.19.16
