a must follow the instructions given personally by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Yad gatv\'e4 na ni}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid6693873 vartante tad dh\'e4ma parama\'e0 mama}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 .}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  One should try to return home, back to Godhead, to the Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha planets\emdash or to the topmost Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha planet, Goloka V\'e5nd\'e4vana\emdash to live eternally in full, blissf
ul knowledge in the company of the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
