of diligently studying the Vedic literature; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 k\'e5tasya}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash of having performed a kind act; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 \'e7obhanam}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the resultant actions; }{
\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 tena}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash by such a resultant action; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 ajan\'e4bhe}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash in the land of Bh\'e4rata-var\'f1a; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 sm\'e5ti-mat janma
}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash a birth enabling one to remember the lotus feet of the Lord; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 na\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash of us; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 sy\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash let there be; 
}{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 var\'f1e}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash in the land; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 hari\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 yat}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 
