\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 prajanan\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash and in producing children; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 svarga-dv\'e4ram}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the gateway to the heavenly planets; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 
