e worship of these five demigods, however, they actually worship Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, the Supersoul of all living entities, as indicated in this verse by the words }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 pratnasya vi\'f1\'ebo r\'fcpam.}{
