 the demigods. People who are almost blind because of lusty desires are recommended to worship the demigods to have their material desires fulfilled, but actually those desires are not fulfilled by the material demigods. Whatever the demigods do is done w
ith the sanction of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. People who are too lusty worship various demigods instead of worshiping Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, the Supersoul of all living entities, but ultimately it is Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u they worship because He is the Supersoul of all demigods.
