icial performances. There is no fault in worshiping the demigods with this understanding, but to think that the demigods are independent of the Supreme Personality of Godhead and equal to Him is called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 h\'e5ta-j\'ef\'e4
