{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 s\'fcrya \'e4tm\'e4 \'e4tmatvenop\'e4sya\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  The actual life and soul of all living entities within this universe is the sun. He is therefore }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 up\'e4sya,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  worshipable. We worship the sun-god by chanting the G\'e4yatr\'e9 }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 o\'e0 bh\'fcr bhuva\'f9 sva\'f9 tat savitur vare\'ebya
