hetun\'e4nena kaunteya\line jagad viparivartate
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "This material nature is working under My direction, O son of Kunt\'e9
, and it is producing all moving and unmoving beings. By its rule this manifestation is created and annihilated again and again."
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
The orbits of the planets resemble the bodies in which all living entities are seated because they are both machines controlled by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 18.61}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ):
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13792173 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e9\'e7vara\'f9 sarva-bh\'fct\'e4n\'e4\'e0\line h\'e5d-de\'e7e 'rjuna ti
\'f1\'f6hati\line bhr\'e4mayan sarva-bh\'fct\'e4ni\line yantr\'e4r\'fc\'f2h\'e4ni m\'e4yay\'e4
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
"The Supreme Lord is situated in everyone's heart, O Arjuna, and is directing the wanderings of all living entities, who are seated as on a machine, made of the material energy." The machine given by material nature\emdash 
whether the machine of the body or the machine of the orbit, or }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 k\'e4la-cakra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
works according to the orders given by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The Supreme Personality of Godhead and material nature work toge
ther to maintain this great universe, and not only this universe but also the millions of other universes beyond this one.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
The question of how the planets and stars are floating is also answered in this verse. It is not because of the laws of gravity. Rath
er, the planets and stars are enabled to float by manipulations of the air. It is due to such manipulations that big, heavy clouds float and big eagles fly in the sky. Modern airplanes like the 747 jet aircraft work in a similar way: by controlling the ai
r, they float high in the sky, resisting the tendency to fall to earth. Such adjustments of the air are all made possible by the cooperation of the principles of }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 puru\'f1a}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (male) and }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 prak\'e5ti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (female). By the cooperation of material nature, which is considered to be }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 prak\'e5ti,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 and the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is considered the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 puru\'f1a,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  all the affairs of the universe are going on nicely in their proper order}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid8852376 .}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4025764  }{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid8852376\charrsid8852376 P}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 rak\'e5ti,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  material nature, is also described in the }{\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Brahma-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\cf1\insrsid11612319 (5.44)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  as follows:
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13792173 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 s\'e5\'f1\'f6i-sthiti-pralaya-s\'e4dhana-\'e7aktir ek\'e4\line ch\'e4
yeva yasya bhuvan\'e4ni bibharti durg\'e4\line icch\'e4nur\'fcpam api yasya ca ce\'f1\'f6ate s\'e4\line govindam \'e4di-puru\'f1a\'e0 tam aha\'e0 bhaj\'e4mi
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "The external potency, }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 m\'e4y\'e4,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  who is of the nature of the shadow of the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 cit}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid8852376 [}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 spiritual}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid8852376 ]}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  potency, is worshiped by all people as Durg\'e4, the creating, preserving and destroying agency of this mundane world. I adore the primeval Lord Govinda, in accordance with whose will Durg\'e4
 conducts herself." Material nature, the external energy of the Supreme Lord, is also known as Durg\'e4, or the female energy that protects the great fort of this universe. The word Durg\'e4
 also means fort. This universe is just like a great fort in which all the conditioned souls are kept, and they cannot leave it unless they are liberated by the mercy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The Lord Himself declares in }{
\cs347\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cf1\insrsid11612319 4.9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ):
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13792173 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 janma karma ca me divyam\line eva\'e0 yo vetti tattvata\'f9\line tyaktv\'e4
 deha\'e0 punar janma\line naiti m\'e4m eti so 'rjuna
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 "One who knows the transcendental nature of My appearance and activit
ies does not, upon leaving the body, take his birth again in this material world, but attains My eternal abode, O Arjuna." Thus simply by K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, by the mercy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, one can be liberated, or, in other words, one can be released from the great fort of this universe and go outside it to the spiritual world.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
It is also significant that the predominating deities of even the greatest planets have been offered their exalted posts because of the very valuable pious activities they performed in previous births. This is indicated herein by the words }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 karma-nirmita-gataya\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  For example, as we have previously discussed, the moon is called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 j\'e9va,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 which means that he is a living entity like us, but because of his pious activitie
s he has been appointed to his post as the moon-god. Similarly, all the demigods are living entities who have been appointed to their various posts as the masters of the moon, the earth, Venus and so on because of their great service and pious acts. Only 
the predominating deity of the sun, S\'fcrya N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, is an incarnation of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Dhruva, the predominating deity of Dhruvaloka, is also a living entity. Thus there are two kinds of entities\emdash 
the supreme entity, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and the ordinary living entity, the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 j\'e9va}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 nityo nity\'e4n\'e4\'e0 cetana\'e7 cetan\'e4n\'e4m}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 ). All the demigods are engaged in the service of the Lord, and only by such an arrangement are the affairs of the universe going on.
\par Regarding the great ea
gles mentioned in this verse, it is understood that there are eagles so big that they can prey on big elephants. They fly so high that they can travel from one planet to another. They start flying in one planet and land in another, and while in flight the
y lay eggs that hatch into other birds while falling through the air. In Sanskrit such eagles are called }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'e7yena.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 Under the present circumstances, of course, we cannot see such huge birds, but at least we know of eagles that can capture monkeys and then throw
 them down to kill and eat them. Similarly, it is understood that there are gigantic birds that can carry off elephants, kill them and eat them.
\par The two examples of the eagle and the cloud are sufficient to prove that flying and floating can be made possib
le through adjustments of the air. The planets, in a similar way, are floating because material nature adjusts the air according to the orders of the Supreme Lord. It could be said that these adjustments constitute the law of gravity, but in any case, one
 must accept that these laws are made by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The so-called scientists have no control over them. The scientists can falsely, improperly declare that there is no God, but this is not a fact.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.23.4
