e Lord returned his kingdom and made him richer than the opulent King Indra. Even now, Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja engages in devotional service by worshiping the Supreme Personality of Godhead in the planet of Sutala.
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13792173 \b\v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\insrsid11612319 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 The Supreme Personality of Godhead is described as Uttama\'e7
loka, "He who is worshiped by the best of selected Sanskrit verses," and His devotees such as Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja are also worshiped by }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 pu\'ebya-\'e7loka,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 verses that increase one's piety. Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja offered everything to the Lord\emdash his wealth, his kingdom and even his own body (}{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 sarv\'e4tma-nivedane bali\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
). The Lord appeared before Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja as a }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  beggar, and Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja gave Him everything he had. However, Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja did not become poor; by donating all his possessions to the Supreme Pers
onality of Godhead, he became a successful devotee and got everything back again with the blessings of the Lord. Similarly, those who give contributions to expand the activities of the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement and to accomplish its objectives will never be losers; they will get their wealth back with the blessings of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. On the other side, those who collect contributions on behalf of the International Society for Krishna Consciousness should be very careful not to use even a farthing of the coll
ection for any purpose other than the transcendental loving service of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qj \li0\ri0\sb600\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9535257 \v\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11612319 SB 5.24.19
