the direct result; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 bh\'fcmi-d\'e4nasya}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash of contribution of land; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 yat}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash which; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 tat}{
