of unlimited numbers of living entities; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 j\'e9va-bh\'fcta-\'e4tma-bh\'fcte}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash who is the life and the Supersoul; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 parama-\'e4tmani}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash 
