\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 sam\'e4hita-manas\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash with an attentive mind; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 sampratip\'e4ditasya}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash which was given; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 s\'e4k\'f1\'e4t
}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash directly; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 apavarga-dv\'e4rasya}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash the gate of liberation; }{\cs337\i\fs28\insrsid11612319 yat}{\fs28\insrsid11612319 \emdash which; }{
