 consists of 4,300,000 years, and therefore the duration of Manu's life is 309,600,000 years. The demigods possess their material opulence only until the end of the life of 
Manu. Time is insurmountable. The time one is allotted, even if it be millions of years, is quickly gone. The demigods own their material possessions only within the limits of time. Therefore Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja lamented that although Indra was very learned, he did not know how to use his intelligence properly, for instead of asking V\'e4manadeva to allow him to engage in His service, Indra used Him to beg Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja for material wealth. Although Indra was learned and his prime minister, B\'e5haspati, was also learned, neither of them begged to be able to render loving service to Lord V\'e4manadeva. Therefore Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja lamented for Indra.
