ither. Liberation and material opulence, he thought, are obstacles to devotional service, and therefore such gifts from the Supreme Personality of Godhead are not His actual mercy. Consequently, instead of accepting the results of karma and j\'ef\'e4
na, Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja simply begged the Lord for engagement in the service of His servant.
