If persons who are very serious about being liberated from material life hear the glories of Anantadeva from the mouth of a spiritual master in the chain of disciplic succession, and if they always meditate upon Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, the Lord enters 
the cores of their hearts, vanquishes all the dirty contamination of the material modes of nature, and cuts to pieces the hard knot within the heart, which has been tied tightly since time immemorial by the desire to dominate material nature through fruit
ive activities. N\'e4rada Muni, the son of Lord Brahm\'e4, always glorifies Anantadeva in his father's assembly. There he sings blissful verses of his own composition, accompanied by his stringed instrument }{\fs28\insrsid12071138 [}{
\fs28\insrsid11612319 or a celestial singer}{\fs28\insrsid12071138 ]}{\fs28\insrsid11612319  known as Tumburu.
