gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  as a commentary on the }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  Therefore all devotees in the Gau\'f2\'e9ya-samprad\'e4ya accept the activities of Lord Ananta related in the }
{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
 as authentic, and they are thus benefited by going back home, back to Godhead. The contamination in the heart of a conditioned soul is like a huge accumulation of garbage created by the three modes of material nature, especially the modes of }{
\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 rajas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319  (passion) and }{\cs337\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 tamas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11612319 
