rada are all pure devotees, eternal servants of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11818543 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 sab\'e4ra p\'fcjita \'e7r\'e9-ananta-mah\'e4\'e7aya\line 
