The Twenty-sixth Chapter describes how a sinful man goes to different hells, where he is punished in various ways by the assistants of Yamar\'e4ja. As stated in the }{\cs347\i\insrsid11612319 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid11612319  (}{
\fs24\insrsid11612319 3.27}{\insrsid11612319 ):
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10907712 \i\f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11612319 prak\'e5te\'f9 kriyam\'e4\'eb\'e4ni\line gu\'ebai\'f9 karm\'e4\'ebi sarva
